// Boxes never overlap. Nothing here says the wide box has to clear "left".
//
// Which way it moves is read off the file: "middle" is right of "left", so
// rightward is the way that contradicts nothing written. And "left" is tall, so
// the two overlap far less horizontally than vertically.

box left    "L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L/L"
box right   "R"                             right of left
box middle  "m"   right of left  left of right  level with left
box wide    "a wide box that overruns both"    below middle  gap: tight
